<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KELLA Analytics Pro - عرض جميع النتائج</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --gold-primary: #d4af37;
            --gold-light: #f3e5ab;
            --gold-dark: #aa8c2c;
            --bg-dark: #0a0a0a;
            --card-bg: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.92);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .overlay {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.88), rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.96));
            padding: 20px;
        }

        #splash-screen {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #1a1a1a 0%, #000000 100%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 9999;
            transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
        }

        .gold-logo {
            font-size: 2.6rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-light), var(--gold-primary), var(--gold-dark));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .splash-sub {
            margin-top: 15px;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        #app-container {
            display: none;
            max-width: 950px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold-primary);
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            padding-top: 10px;
        }

        header h1 {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-light), var(--gold-primary));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            font-size: 1.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .sound-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-primary);
            color: var(--gold-light);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .sports-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .sport-cell {
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            position: relative;
            cursor: pointer;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 2px solid var(--gold-dark);
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            justify-content: center;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        .sport-cell::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 20%, rgba(0,0,0,0.3) 100%);
        }

        .sport-title {
            color: var(--gold-light);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        #sub-view {
            display: none;
        }

        .back-btn {
            background: var(--gold-primary);
            color: #000;
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .status-tabs {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-dark);
            color: #aaa;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .tab-btn.active {
            background: var(--gold-primary);
            color: #000;
        }

        .leagues-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
            max-height: 55vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 5px;
        }

        .league-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-dark);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        #analytics-view {
            display: none;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 2px solid var(--gold-primary);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 18px;
        }

        .match-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .analytics-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .stat-box {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .stat-title {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .stat-value {
            color: var(--gold-light);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="splash-screen">
        <div class="gold-logo">KELLA Analytics Pro</div>
        <div class="splash-sub" id="loading-text">جاري الاتصال بالسحابة... (0%)</div>
    </div>

    <div class="overlay">
        <div id="app-container">
            <header>
                <h1>KELLA Analytics Pro</h1>
                <p style="color: var(--gold-light); font-size: 0.85rem;">منصة التحليل والذكاء الاصطناعي الرياضي</p>
                <button id="sound-toggle-btn" class="sound-btn" onclick="toggleMusic()">
                    🔇 <span>تشغيل الموسيقى</span>
                </button>
            </header>

            <div id="main-dashboard" class="sports-grid">
                <div class="sport-cell" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508098682722-e99c43a406b2?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop');" onclick="openLeagues('football')">
                    <div class="sport-title">كرة القدم (التحليل الذكي)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="sport-cell" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546519638-68e109498ffc?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop');" onclick="openLeagues('basketball')">
                    <div class="sport-title">كرة السلة</div>
                </div>
                <div class="sport-cell" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622163642998-1ea32b1ab639?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop');" onclick="openLeagues('tennis')">
                    <div class="sport-title">التنس</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="sub-view">
                <button class="back-btn" onclick="goBackToMain()">← العودة للرئيسية</button>
                <h2 id="selected-sport-title" style="color: var(--gold-primary); margin-bottom: 1
